Error [E0112]: `field` wants WebForm for argument 1, but this is String (text)
  --> tests/ui/web_suite_forms_type_mismatch.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     forms.field("wrong-form", "carrier", "String", true)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Use WebForm here
